Market cap: $${((p.usd_market_cap ?? 0)/1e9).toFixed(2)}B

Respond ONLY with valid JSON, no markdown:
{"signal":"BUY","confidence":85,"reason":"Strong momentum with support","momentum":"bullish","risk":"medium"}

Signal must be exactly BUY, SELL, or HOLD. Confidence 0-100. Risk: low/medium/high.`
          }]
        })
